- transport_leg_available transport_leg_alpha
- loading_container_available loading_container_alpha, loading_container_beta
- candidate_origin_availability_linked shift_candidate_alpha origin_availability_alpha
- candidate_origin_availability_linked shift_candidate_beta origin_availability_alpha
- candidate_destination_availability_linked shift_candidate_alpha destination_availability_alpha
- candidate_destination_availability_linked shift_candidate_beta destination_availability_alpha
- candidate_transport_leg_linked shift_candidate_alpha transport_leg_alpha
- candidate_transport_leg_linked shift_candidate_beta transport_leg_alpha
- candidate_loading_container_linked shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha
- candidate_loading_container_linked shift_candidate_beta loading_container_beta
- equipment_available equipment_resource_alpha, equipment_resource_beta
- service_window_available service_window_alpha, service_window_beta
- dispatch_slot_available dispatch_slot_alpha
- skill_certificate_available skill_certificate_alpha
- operational_constraint_available operational_constraint_alpha, operational_constraint_beta
- candidate_operational_constraint_linked shift_candidate_alpha operational_constraint_alpha
- candidate_operational_constraint_linked shift_candidate_beta operational_constraint_beta
- compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha

No candidate_created, no vehicle_allocated, no candidate_task_profile_linked, no candidate_operator_linked, no candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, no candidate_skill_certificate_linked, no equipment_reserved, no candidate_equipment_linked, no dispatch_allocated, no dispatch_ready, no candidate_finalized, no dispatch_allocated for any candidate, no origin_availability_locked, no origin_availability_confirmed, no destination_availability_locked, no destination_availability_confirmed, no origin_node_ready, no destination_node_ready, no origin_node_occupied, no destination_node_occupied, no transport_leg_assembled, no transport_leg_loading_authorized, no loading_container_loaded, no loading_container_leg_linked, no candidate_staged_for_loading, no candidate_loading_verified, no candidate_clearance_established, no route_sequence_context_set, no route_sequence_validated, no constraint_applied, no operator_alignment_confirmed, no compliance_validation_complete.

Now step by step.

Step1: create_candidate origin_availability_alpha
Precondition: not candidate_created ?c, not dispatched ?c. Both false. Effect: candidate_created origin_availability_alpha.

Step2: allocate_vehicle_unit origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha
Precondition: candidate_created ?c, not vehicle_allocated ?c, vehicle_available ?v.
We have candidate_created true, vehicle_allocated false, vehicle_available true. Effect: vehicle_allocated, candidate_vehicle_linked, not vehicle_available.

